---
import { evidence } from '../content/portfolio';
---

<section class="section evidence" id="evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading evidence-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">QA EVIDENCE</p>
        <h2 id="evidence-title">QA 판단 사례</h2>
      </div>
      <p>문서 충돌과 Build Crash에서 테스트 진입 조건을 판단하고, 공유 모듈의 영향 범위까지 재검증했습니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="evidence-grid">
      {evidence.map((item) => (
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <span class="evidence-number">EVIDENCE {item.number}</span>
          <h3>{item.title}</h3>
          <p>{item.message}</p>
          <ul class="keyword-list" role="list">
            {item.keywords.map((keyword) => <li>{keyword}</li>)}
          </ul>
          <a class="text-link" href={item.href}>{item.cta}</a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="evidence-more"><a class="text-link" href="/work-samples/">원본 자료 보기 →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
